{"seq":1,"slug":"submodules-and-subtrees","title":"子模块与子树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/submodules-and-subtrees","wordCount":744,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"子模块与子树\">子模块与子树</h1><h2 id=\"monorepo-与-polyrepo\">Monorepo 与 Polyrepo</h2><p>在组织多项目代码时，有两种主要策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>代表项目</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Monorepo</td>\n<td>所有项目放在一个仓库中</td>\n<td>Google、Meta、Vercel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Polyrepo</td>\n<td>每个项目一个独立仓库</td>\n<td>大多数开源项目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Monorepo&#10;        M[单仓库] --&gt; A1[app-a/]&#10;        M --&gt; A2[app-b/]&#10;        M --&gt; L1[lib-shared/]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Polyrepo&#10;        R1[repo: app-a] -.-&gt; R3[repo: lib-shared]&#10;        R2[repo: app-b] -.-&gt; R3&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Monorepo\n        M[单仓库] --&gt; A1[app-a/]\n        M --&gt; A2[app-b/]\n        M --&gt; L1[lib-shared/]\n    end\n    subgraph Polyrepo\n        R1[repo: app-a] -.-&gt; R3[repo: lib-shared]\n        R2[repo: app-b] -.-&gt; R3\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>Monorepo</th>\n<th>Polyrepo</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代码共享</td>\n<td>直接引用</td>\n<td>需发包/submodule</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原子提交</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI/CD 复杂度</td>\n<td>高（需按变更触发）</td>\n<td>低（独立管线）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仓库体积</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限控制</td>\n<td>粗粒度</td>\n<td>细粒度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具要求</td>\n<td>高（需专用工具）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在仓库之间共享代码，核心是决定&quot;引用式嵌入还是内容式复制&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Submodule</td>\n<td>以引用方式嵌入外部仓库，记录其特定 commit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Subtree</td>\n<td>把外部仓库内容复制进本仓库子目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.gitmodules</td>\n<td>记录子模块路径与 URL 的配置文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递归克隆</td>\n<td>克隆时一并初始化所有子模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Monorepo</td>\n<td>所有项目同仓，支持原子提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Polyrepo</td>\n<td>每项目独立仓库，权限粒度更细</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-submodule\">Git Submodule</h2><p><strong>子模块（Submodule）</strong> 在当前仓库中嵌入另一个 Git 仓库的引用，记录特定的 commit：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git submodule add https://github.com/org/lib.git libs/shared&#10;git submodule init&#10;git submodule update&#10;&#10;git clone --recurse-submodules https://github.com/user/repo.git&#10;&#10;git submodule update --remote\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> submodule</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/lib.git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> libs/shared</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> submodule</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> submodule</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --recurse-submodules</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/user/repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> submodule</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --remote</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    P[主仓库] --&gt; S1[&quot;.gitmodules&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; D1[&quot;libs/shared (submodule)&quot;]&#10;    D1 --&gt;|指向| C[&quot;lib repo @ commit abc123&quot;]\">graph TD\n    P[主仓库] --&gt; S1[\".gitmodules\"]\n    P --&gt; D1[\"libs/shared (submodule)\"]\n    D1 --&gt;|指向| C[\"lib repo @ commit abc123\"]</pre><p>Submodule 的文件结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cat .gitmodules&#10;# [submodule &quot;libs/shared&quot;]&#10;#   path = libs/shared&#10;#   url = https://github.com/org/lib.git&#10;&#10;cat .git/config&#10;git submodule status\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .gitmodules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># [submodule \"libs/shared\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   path = libs/shared</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   url = https://github.com/org/lib.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git/config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> submodule</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>命令</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>添加子模块</td>\n<td><code>git submodule add &lt;url&gt; &lt;path&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>初始化</td>\n<td><code>git submodule init</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新到记录的版本</td>\n<td><code>git submodule update</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新到远程最新</td>\n<td><code>git submodule update --remote</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递归克隆</td>\n<td><code>git clone --recurse-submodules &lt;url&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除子模块</td>\n<td><code>git submodule deinit &lt;path&gt;</code> + <code>git rm &lt;path&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Submodule 的最大痛点是容易忘记初始化和更新。使用 <code>git clone --recurse-submodules</code> 或配置 <code>submodule.recurse=true</code> 可以减少这类问题。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-subtree\">Git Subtree</h2><p><strong>子树（Subtree）</strong> 将外部仓库的内容直接合并到当前仓库的子目录中，不需要额外的 <code>.gitmodules</code> 配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git subtree add --prefix=libs/shared https://github.com/org/lib.git main --squash&#10;&#10;git subtree pull --prefix=libs/shared https://github.com/org/lib.git main --squash&#10;&#10;git subtree push --prefix=libs/shared https://github.com/org/lib.git main\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> subtree</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prefix=libs/shared</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/lib.git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --squash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> subtree</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prefix=libs/shared</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/lib.git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --squash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> subtree</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prefix=libs/shared</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/lib.git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git remote add shared-lib https://github.com/org/lib.git&#10;git subtree add --prefix=libs/shared shared-lib main --squash&#10;git subtree pull --prefix=libs/shared shared-lib main --squash\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> shared-lib</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/lib.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> subtree</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prefix=libs/shared</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> shared-lib</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --squash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> subtree</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prefix=libs/shared</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> shared-lib</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --squash</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"submodule-vs-subtree\">Submodule vs Subtree</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>Submodule</th>\n<th>Subtree</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储方式</td>\n<td>引用（指向 commit）</td>\n<td>完整复制到仓库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仓库体积</td>\n<td>小（不含子仓库内容）</td>\n<td>大（包含全部内容）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>克隆复杂度</td>\n<td>需要额外初始化</td>\n<td>普通克隆即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新方式</td>\n<td>submodule update</td>\n<td>subtree pull</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贡献回推</td>\n<td>在子仓库中操作</td>\n<td>subtree push</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史独立性</td>\n<td>完全独立</td>\n<td>混合在主仓库历史中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>较陡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A{选择依据} --&gt; B{需要频繁更新?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[Subtree]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{团队熟悉度?}&#10;    D --&gt;|Submodule| E[Submodule]&#10;    D --&gt;|偏好简单| F[Subtree]&#10;    A --&gt; G{需要贡献回推?}&#10;    G --&gt;|频繁| H[Submodule]&#10;    G --&gt;|很少| I[Subtree]\">graph TD\n    A{选择依据} --&gt; B{需要频繁更新?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[Subtree]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{团队熟悉度?}\n    D --&gt;|Submodule| E[Submodule]\n    D --&gt;|偏好简单| F[Subtree]\n    A --&gt; G{需要贡献回推?}\n    G --&gt;|频繁| H[Submodule]\n    G --&gt;|很少| I[Subtree]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-工具生态\">Monorepo 工具生态</h2><p>当选择 Monorepo 架构时，通常需要专用工具来管理构建和依赖：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>语言生态</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Turborepo</td>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>增量构建，缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nx</td>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>计算缓存，影响分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lerna</td>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>版本管理，发包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bazel</td>\n<td>多语言</td>\n<td>Google 开源，可扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pants</td>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>细粒度缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rush</td>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>微软出品，企业级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npx create-turbo@latest&#10;pnpm --filter app-a build&#10;pnpm --filter &quot;./packages/*&quot; test\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create-turbo@latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app-a</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"./packages/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((子模块与子树))&#10;    Submodule&#10;      引用式嵌入&#10;      独立历史&#10;      需要初始化&#10;    Subtree&#10;      完整复制&#10;      混合历史&#10;      普通克隆即可&#10;    Monorepo&#10;      原子提交&#10;      代码共享&#10;      需要专用工具&#10;    Polyrepo&#10;      独立仓库&#10;      细粒度权限&#10;      简单管线\">mindmap\n  root((子模块与子树))\n    Submodule\n      引用式嵌入\n      独立历史\n      需要初始化\n    Subtree\n      完整复制\n      混合历史\n      普通克隆即可\n    Monorepo\n      原子提交\n      代码共享\n      需要专用工具\n    Polyrepo\n      独立仓库\n      细粒度权限\n      简单管线</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Submodule</strong> 以引用方式嵌入外部仓库，保持历史独立性，适合松耦合的依赖管理</li>\n<li><strong>Subtree</strong> 将外部代码完整合并到主仓库，对使用者透明，但会增加仓库体积</li>\n<li><strong>Monorepo</strong> 支持原子提交和直接代码共享，但需要 Turborepo、Nx 等专用工具支持</li>\n<li><strong>Polyrepo</strong> 更简单，适合独立性强的项目，但跨仓库的代码共享和一致性维护成本高</li>\n<li>选择策略需综合考虑<strong>团队规模、代码耦合度、CI/CD 成熟度和权限需求</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"子模块与子树","id":"子模块与子树"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 与 Polyrepo","id":"monorepo-与-polyrepo"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Submodule","id":"git-submodule"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Subtree","id":"git-subtree"},{"level":2,"text":"Submodule vs Subtree","id":"submodule-vs-subtree"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 工具生态","id":"monorepo-工具生态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Code Review 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration/code-review-practices"},"next":{"title":"稀疏检出与部分克隆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/sparse-checkout"}}